<title>JAPAN: Japan Nov construction orders fall 11.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Nov construction orders fall 11.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's construction orders in November fell 11.5 percent from a year earlier to 1.26 trillion yen, the Construction Ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The following is a breakdown (in billions of yen unless specified, with year-on-year changes):</p>
<p> Domestic private-sector orders		  699.41   -1.4</p>
<p> Domestic public-sector orders		   458.42  -22.8</p>
<p>Foreign government facilities in Japan and</p>
<p> orders of less than 10 million yen	     42.67   +5.9</p>
<p> Orders received abroad			     56.36  -26.5</p>
<p> Total						1.26 trln  -11.5</p>
</text>
